---
import Layout from '../../../components/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Compatibility Theory - Numero Girija">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href={`${base}learn/`}>Learning Portal</a> / <a href={`${base}learn/relationships/`}>Relationships</a> / Compatibility Theory
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h1 class="section-title">🔮 Numerology Compatibility Theory</h1>

        <div class="intro-section">
            <p>
                Understanding numerical compatibility is crucial for successful relationships, whether romantic, business, or friendship. In numerology, compatibility is determined by analyzing how different numbers interact based on their planetary rulers and elemental qualities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="theory-section">
            <h2>📊 The Three Levels of Compatibility</h2>

            <div class="level-card excellent">
                <div class="level-header">
                    <span class="level-icon">⭐⭐⭐</span>
                    <h3>Excellent Compatibility (90-100%)</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Characteristics:</strong> Natural harmony, mutual understanding, similar goals and values</p>
                <p><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>1 with 1, 3, 9 - Leadership and creativity blend perfectly</li>
                    <li>2 with 7, 9 - Emotional and spiritual connection</li>
                    <li>3 with 6, 9 - Creative and harmonious partnership</li>
                    <li>5 with 1, 3, 5 - Dynamic and freedom-loving</li>
                    <li>6 with 3, 6, 9 - Loving and balanced</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Result:</strong> Long-lasting relationships, easy communication, mutual growth</p>
            </div>

            <div class="level-card good">
                <div class="level-header">
                    <span class="level-icon">⭐⭐</span>
                    <h3>Good Compatibility (70-89%)</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Characteristics:</strong> Workable differences, complementary strengths, requires effort</p>
                <p><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>1 with 2, 5 - Different but complementary approaches</li>
                    <li>4 with 1, 6 - Stability meets dynamism</li>
                    <li>7 with 2, 4 - Introspection meets emotion/practicality</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Result:</strong> Successful with understanding and compromise, balance each other's weaknesses</p>
            </div>

            <div class="level-card challenging">
                <div class="level-header">
                    <span class="level-icon">⭐</span>
                    <h3>Challenging Compatibility (Below 70%)</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Characteristics:</strong> Conflicting energies, different values, requires significant work</p>
                <p><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>1 with 8 - Sun vs Saturn: ego clashes, power struggles</li>
                    <li>4 with 8, 9 - Rahu-Saturn-Mars conflicts</li>
                    <li>5 with 8, 9 - Mercury troubled by Saturn/Mars</li>
                    <li>8 with 9 - Saturn-Mars natural enemies</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Result:</strong> Needs extra patience, understanding, and spiritual maturity to work</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="factors-section">
            <h2>🎯 Five Key Compatibility Factors</h2>

            <div class="factor-card">
                <h4>1. Driver Number Compatibility</h4>
                <p><strong>Most Important:</strong> Your day of birth (Driver) determines your core personality</p>
                <p>Check if your Driver numbers are friendly, neutral, or enemies based on planetary relationships</p>
                <div class="example-box">
                    <strong>Example:</strong> Driver 1 (Sun) + Driver 9 (Mars) = Excellent (Sun-Mars are friends)<br>
                    Driver 1 (Sun) + Driver 8 (Saturn) = Challenging (Sun-Saturn are enemies)
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="factor-card">
                <h4>2. Conductor Number Harmony</h4>
                <p><strong>Secondary Importance:</strong> Life path number (full DOB sum) shows life direction</p>
                <p>Compatible Conductors share similar life goals and values</p>
                <div class="example-box">
                    <strong>Example:</strong> Conductor 3 (Jupiter) + Conductor 6 (Venus) = Good (mutual appreciation)<br>
                    Conductor 4 (Rahu) + Conductor 9 (Mars) = Challenging (conflicting approaches)
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="factor-card">
                <h4>3. Name Number Influence</h4>
                <p>Your name number affects how others perceive you and how you communicate</p>
                <p>Harmonious name numbers improve understanding and expression in relationships</p>
                <div class="example-box">
                    <strong>Tip:</strong> Even if Driver/Conductor clash, favorable name numbers can ease communication
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="factor-card">
                <h4>4. Missing & Repetitive Numbers</h4>
                <p>What's absent in one person's chart, the other may provide</p>
                <p>Complementary grids create balance (one's strength fills another's gap)</p>
                <div class="example-box">
                    <strong>Example:</strong> Person A missing 2 (emotions) + Person B has 2,2,2 = Emotional balance in relationship
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="factor-card">
                <h4>5. Personal Year Cycles</h4>
                <p>Check if both partners are in compatible Personal Year phases</p>
                <p>Mismatched cycles (one in Year 1, other in Year 9) can cause timing issues</p>
                <div class="example-box">
                    <strong>Tip:</strong> Marry or start business when both are in favorable Personal Years (1, 3, 5, 6)
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="planetary-section">
            <h2>🌟 Planetary Friendship & Enmity</h2>

            <div class="planetary-grid">
                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>1 - Sun ☀️</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 2, 3, 9</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 4, 5, 6, 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 8</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>2 - Moon 🌙</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 1, 3, 5, 7, 9</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 6</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 4, 8</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>3 - Jupiter 🪐</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 1, 2, 6, 9</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 4, 5, 8</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>4 - Rahu 🌑</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 5, 6, 8</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 1, 2, 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 3, 9</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>5 - Mercury ☿️</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 1, 3, 4, 5, 6</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 2, 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 8, 9</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>6 - Venus ♀️</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 3, 4, 5, 8</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 2, 7, 9</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 1</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>7 - Ketu 🔮</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 2, 9</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> None (mostly neutral)</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>8 - Saturn ♄</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 4, 5, 6</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 2, 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 1, 3, 9</p>
                </div>

                <div class="planet-card">
                    <h4>9 - Mars ♂️</h4>
                    <p><strong>Friends:</strong> 1, 2, 3, 7</p>
                    <p><strong>Neutral:</strong> 5, 6</p>
                    <p><strong>Enemies:</strong> 4, 8</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tips-section">
            <h2>💡 Improving Difficult Relationships</h2>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>1. Name Correction</h4>
                <p>Change name spelling to create a favorable name number that's compatible with both partners</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>2. Wear Complementary Gemstones</h4>
                <p>Both partners wear their favorable gemstones to strengthen individual energies</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>3. Choose Favorable Dates</h4>
                <p>Schedule important events (wedding, business launch) on dates favorable to both</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>4. Home Direction & Colors</h4>
                <p>Use colors and directions that balance both partners' energies</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>5. Spiritual Remedies</h4>
                <p>Both partners chant mantras, perform pujas for peace and harmony</p>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-card">
                <h4>6. Timing Is Everything</h4>
                <p>Avoid major decisions when either is in Personal Year 4, 8, or 9 (challenging periods)</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps">
            <h3>Continue Learning</h3>
            <div class="next-links">
                <a href={`${base}learn/relationships/partner-matching/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>Next: Partner Matching Guide →</span>
                </a>
                <a href={`${base}compatibility/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>Check Your Compatibility →</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .breadcrumb {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #6b3fa0;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .intro-section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .intro-section p {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .theory-section, .factors-section, .planetary-section, .tips-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .theory-section h2, .factors-section h2, .planetary-section h2, .tips-section h2 {
            color: #2d1b69;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .level-card {
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .level-card.excellent {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4, #dcfce7);
            border: 2px solid #10b981;
        }

        .level-card.good {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9e7, #fef3c7);
            border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
        }

        .level-card.challenging {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f5, #ffe5e5);
            border: 2px solid #ef4444;
        }

        .level-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .level-icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .level-card h3 {
            color: #2d1b69;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .level-card p {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .level-card ul {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .level-card li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .factor-card, .tip-card {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid #e8e8e8;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .factor-card h4, .tip-card h4 {
            color: #6b3fa0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .factor-card p, .tip-card p {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .example-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9f5ff, #f0ebff);
            border-left: 4px solid #6b3fa0;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #444;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .example-box strong {
            color: #6b3fa0;
        }

        .planetary-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .planetary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            .planetary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .planet-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9f5ff, #f0ebff);
            border: 2px solid #6b3fa0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
        }

        .planet-card h4 {
            color: #2d1b69;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .planet-card p {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .planet-card strong {
            color: #6b3fa0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .next-steps {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9e5, #ffedd5);
            border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .next-steps h3 {
            color: #f59e0b;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .next-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .next-link {
            background: white;
            border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #f59e0b;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .next-link:hover {
            background: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .next-links {
                flex-direction: row;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>
